  "title": "Jalapeño Popper Dip",
  "description": "This creamy jalapeño popper dip with crispy bacon bits, spicy jalapeños, Cheddar, and crunchy cracker crumbs has all the flavors of jalapeño poppers in a warm dip!",
  "authors": [
    "countrygirl"
