  "ingredients": [
    "7 slices bacon, diced",
    "2 (8 ounce) packages cream cheese, softened",
    "1 cup mayonnaise",
    "1 cup shredded Cheddar cheese",
    "0.5 cup shredded mozzarella cheese",
    "0.25 cup chopped green onion",
    "5 jalapeno peppers, seeded and chopped",
    "1 cup crushed buttery round crackers",
    "0.5 cup grated Parmesan cheese",
    "0.25 cup butter, melted"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4REIp80qhzGR4kuaUylq4Tn4R3I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-233350-jalapeno-popper-dip-VAT-step-01-56b74b0020184dfa8d87f2f478885a2e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233350/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the dip: Cook and stir bacon in a large skillet over medium-high heat until crisp, about 10 minutes. Transfer with a slotted spoon to a paper towel-lined plate lined to drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TfJ6_nXjX40okDWFiNoHQZOM3zY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-233350-jalapeno-popper-dip-VAT-step-03-ecbb380b16f84de891c16c00a651a0ea.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233350/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir cream cheese, mayonnaise, Cheddar, mozzarella, green onion, jalapeño peppers, and bacon together in a bowl; spread into a 9-inch round baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/F6soQgBsRSoCpmnOX-fdsjY4B2Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-233350-jalapeno-popper-dip-VAT-step-02-62fda175592c484a8387aeb40f842b70.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233350/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the topping: Mix crackers, Parmesan, and melted butter together in a bowl. Spread over cream cheese mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NzsH8EiwtqifXzvtXa9d_bM0bWw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-233350-jalapeno-popper-dip-VAT-step-05-c7890f185a814868aa824f726162e9d1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233350/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until bubbly, 20 to 30 minutes. Garnish with green onions and serve warm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-4KVpdJoWqMg3fI-hHTRYk2l3zs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-233350-jalapeno-popper-dip-VAT-step-06-4afb91276d8549d9afa18536b05a5226.jpg"
